\details{
The package provides the \code{dijkstra()} function for calculating
shortest distances in a weighted graph using Dijkstra's algorithm,
and the \code{euclidean()} function for calculating the greatest
common divisor using the Euclidean algorithm.

The package also includes the \code{wiki_graph} dataset, which
contains the edges and weights of a graph used with the
\code{dijkstra()} function.
